{:tier :glm-5.2, :verse 11, :comments ["<b>And he began</b> — ויחל. Four times in the Masorah: here, and the second: ויחל יהואחז, and: ויחל וגו׳, concerning Hezekiah, and: ויחל איש האלהים, in the matter of Jeroboam. This is as stated in Berakhot chapter 4: how long does one wait between prayer and prayer? Long enough for his mind to settle upon him. And they interpret it from ויחל. And they interpret in the Jerusalem Talmud that it is four amot, corresponding to the four occurrences of ויחל."], :book :exodus, :voice :baal-haturim, :lang :en, :chapter 32, :notes {}, :source-witnesses [["On Your Way" "http://mobile.tora.ws/"]], :timestamp "2026-07-12T19:14:55.136371534Z", :translated-from :he, :model "glm-5.2"}